(Bug #54, the loop spelling: `part` holds an element of a list proven to
 hold numbers, so writing it into a text was the same mismatched read as
 `element 1 of counts` - and the Print segfaulted the same way.)

a text called label is "x".
a list called counts is [1, 2].
For each part in counts,
    label is part.
Print label.
